# StoryMapper Environment Configuration
#
# LOCAL MODE (default):
#   Leave the Supabase variables commented out or empty.
#   Data persists in the browser's IndexedDB automatically.
#   Export maps as JSON files for backup and portability.
#
# CLOUD MODE (optional):
#   Uncomment and fill in the two Supabase variables below to use
#   a Supabase backend for multi-device sync. First run supabase/schema.sql
#   in your Supabase project to create the tables and RLS policies.

# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
